{%- comment -%}
  Used Conex — alt text for Shopify Files images, keyed by filename.
  Rendered (captured) by uc-img. Output:
    text  → used as the alt
    '-'   → decorative icon that always sits beside its own label: alt=""
    blank → not mapped; uc-img falls back to the section's alt
  Add a line here whenever a new image is uploaded to Shopify Files.
{%- endcomment -%}
